msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Her? She should be in the dining hall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ela? Deve estar no refeitório."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E42A706C_CB27_470E_95C7_5E3E5CDA825D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 25edfd9431126a755faab80da2ca3ae7e0397a1af23c062d9c3a620742c6ca87
#. default-sha256: 762b1eddc161ebd618a9ee724160dcdf9ee666a49e4ff81fc4108fd4d3930d75
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E42A706C_CB27_470E_95C7_5E3E5CDA825D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That’s when we go up into the tower.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫...Though even if they were on the "
"property,⟪k:5⟫you wouldn’t be able to just walk up and talk to them.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Especially not the "
"lord."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫É quando subimos na torre.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫...Embora mesmo que eles estivessem na "
"propriedade,⟪k:5⟫você não seria capaz de simplesmente ir falar com eles.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Especialmente "
"não com o lorde."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8F0BBBC3_47A2_476E_8486_AB7488405E97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21047ab45fa199fbef5f88ddbbd34af1342e094f89f1f2bd80f7759f2c536e26
#. default-sha256: 7cf3971852b7824d4f3b15363af4247bf7095f9d9919bea9f4f33437cc9bc49e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8F0BBBC3_47A2_476E_8486_AB7488405E97"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Also, I don’t keep track of where they go or what they do, sorry...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I, ⟪k:4⟫"
"well... ⟪k:5⟫I don’t really ⟪k:6⟫want⟪k:7⟫ to know what they’re up to..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Além disso, não acompanho onde eles vão ou o que fazem, desculpe...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Eu, ⟪k:4⟫"
"bem... ⟪k:5⟫eu realmente não ⟪k:6⟫quero⟪k:7⟫ saber o que eles estão fazendo..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_27B9C282_B9A4_4780_803F_602A4C63B24D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36c85e403005c5eaa73e1c4aee8f0a5d64a1a60f38869d0592d818b8f5563bb1
