msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But I’m used to it, so don’t worry about me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mas estou acostumada com isso, então não se preocupe comigo!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D5820516_97A8_4C88_8685_55DF6643BC0B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a8502d731be2b3f9ee06ef12c09464bac28eb3ba329409066b3eb6744fc5911
#. default-sha256: 0e1ac570f0b0a8d4cc7580d12a3c1741aa186587622a09871f4adc602b6f672e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D5820516_97A8_4C88_8685_55DF6643BC0B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Which means, when my eyes are closed, she has no light at all...)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(O que significa que, quando meus olhos estão fechados, ela não tem luz alguma...)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F7488AA8_4EDB_4346_A046_3EBA43BC2A41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b0a33fa7a20b744e965d751571dd1111a069b1539bcb5dc332377c55e92d27c
#. default-sha256: 2dc085482784c338c195c428747f1101d2bb72f4fc8b96e5b4bc1967da3f8796
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F7488AA8_4EDB_4346_A046_3EBA43BC2A41"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You won’t have the energy to do anything if you don’t keep yourself well rested "
"and nourished."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Não terá energia para fazer nada se não se manter bem descansado e nutrido."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2F3F51A3_D154_4F08_8CAB_04A82112DF8F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8696a030f9c2923a7006a6141b10cc1109f28cf165d9a1d5682de448bba00d74
#. default-sha256: 2fb623b947e3ad2f6aa585d5473dca3b0adfc4fbf829866d9e8a9591640d544f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2F3F51A3_D154_4F08_8CAB_04A82112DF8F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Sitting in the center of the room is a long table, lined with bread and wine."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫No centro da sala há uma mesa comprida, forrada com pão e vinho.."

#: scenario8:scenario8_781D2988_007B_4129_8E5B_D73C73D5793B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5ab3638e40340ae94c17a36cccd5f1e3784b002152eaf8cb89b5174e58ed7b0
#. default-sha256: 44e7524c48e267ba6eeca8ac80220d593b0d9556ff8e1406a029e6a6a57d2094
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_781D2988_007B_4129_8E5B_D73C73D5793B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The majority of people in the room look poor, like they genuinely need the assistance, but "
"there are a handful of those who look more than well off."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A maioria das pessoas na sala parece pobre, como se realmente precisasse de ajuda, mas há um "
"punhado de pessoas que parecem mais do que abastadas."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5FBA3FAD_9898_4571_B9AF_DEA3F9A071C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0671127340bb996e1241942f56bde20955d3111a5ab0906026e835c220785d8
#. default-sha256: 86c7e069b71ce5a34ee339f31073f310cf9627219513bef0924572eb746c9bad
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5FBA3FAD_9898_4571_B9AF_DEA3F9A071C1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They don’t seem to be for want of supplies at the moment, though. ⟪k:3⟫I assume "
"that’s thanks to the lord’s patronage."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No entanto, eles não parecem estar carentes de suprimentos no momento. ⟪k:3⟫"
"Presumo que seja graças ao patrocínio do lorde."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4BC57774_1CF9_46D4_B960_2378768987EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa90bbda9a64ceff05563ac9184b9e52d68bec7f4117f6db59b0240d04714140
#. default-sha256: 9ccccfdc9a7a60dd83daa0c5fd2fc2e9c924e0a33df0215bedbc71d1a6c7d1d4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4BC57774_1CF9_46D4_B960_2378768987EC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Give it a rest already, young man!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Can’tcha see, she ain’t interested!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dá um tempo, meu jovem!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Cé não vê, ela não tá interessada!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F1FD8954_1505_450D_BACF_2D4A20E4BF61
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bde42379d01a34c0442e8db9f25cedba0ee04bd922751999a3f5dc2ccdd49d5d
#. default-sha256: 6833106d0c4c526eee2e6df72b02f3a139567b59afd0035743ef8cc17fe21c80
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F1FD8954_1505_450D_BACF_2D4A20E4BF61"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Wha— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ah, ⟪k:4⟫wait—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Que— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ah, ⟪k:4⟫espere—!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_124CB209_1F0B_48D0_B8FD_8276777E2E89
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61df2477adad97c34c6b811d2271c341011e60e2fb2d9e3a0bc73314fe759cca
#. default-sha256: fe3e4ef634c441f8322c73d801b00b23ec28f228609416e6e68149181c0706a4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_124CB209_1F0B_48D0_B8FD_8276777E2E89"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Of course, our Saintess!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Pick it up, young man!⟪k:5⟫Ya need some time "
"outside ta cool off!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Claro, nossa Santa!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Se liga, jovem!⟪k:5⟫Cê precisa de um tempo lá fora "
"pra refresca!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6ADE54BF_F95E_4EE3_97AA_AB543F997F27
